<title>INDIA: India 96/97 fiscal deficit seen at 5 pct.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 fiscal deficit seen at 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Finance Minister P. Chidambaram said on Friday that there was no change in the government's budget estimate of the 1996/97 (April-March) fiscal deficit which remained at five percent of gross domestic product (GDP).</p>
<p>&quot;There is no change in the budget estimate of the fiscal deficit which would remain at five percent of GDP,&quot; Chidambaram said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
